<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2162063142"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1746937899"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Last Time"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Max Lange / Harlan Posey / Dru Laine"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Last Time"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:35.890"><div begin="00:01.370" end="03:35.890"><p begin="00:01.370" end="00:03.120" itunes:key="L1">Blame's on me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">错在我</span></p><p begin="00:03.120" end="00:05.220" itunes:key="L2">Told me up front, what you didn't want<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你直截了当地告诉我你不想要什么</span></p><p begin="00:05.220" end="00:08.940" itunes:key="L3">I was so dumb to agree<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愚蠢地同意了</span></p><p begin="00:08.940" end="00:12.160" itunes:key="L4">Didn't think that it would take a toll<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没想到这会带来如此沉重的代价</span></p><p begin="00:12.160" end="00:14.170" itunes:key="L5">Lost my damn mind, 'round the same time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在失去理智的同时</span></p><p begin="00:14.170" end="00:17.800" itunes:key="L6">That I lost my self control<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也失去了自我控制</span></p><p begin="00:17.800" end="00:20.880" itunes:key="L7">You got me by my heart strings now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你牵动着我的心弦</span></p><p begin="00:20.880" end="00:23.220" itunes:key="L8">But you're not tryin' to attach<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你却不愿承诺</span></p><p begin="00:23.220" end="00:25.420" itunes:key="L9">Need unwrapped around your finger<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被你牢牢掌控</span></p><p begin="00:25.420" end="00:27.680" itunes:key="L10">Why's this hurt me so bad?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何这伤痛如此深</span></p><p begin="00:27.680" end="00:32.080" itunes:key="L11">Guess I should known better, than to think you could change<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我早该明白</span></p><p begin="00:32.080" end="00:34.900" itunes:key="L12">And not run away<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我选择逃避</span></p><p begin="00:34.900" end="00:37.610" itunes:key="L13">Why'd you leave me out in the cold?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何将我遗弃在寒冷中</span></p><p begin="00:37.610" end="00:42.160" itunes:key="L14">Never made it clear, never made it right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未明确表态 从未纠正错误</span></p><p begin="00:42.160" end="00:46.730" itunes:key="L15">I've been waitin' here, for at least a goodbye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">错误 错误</span></p><p begin="00:46.730" end="00:51.160" itunes:key="L16">Show up at my door, look me in the eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出现在我门前 直视我的双眼</span></p><p begin="00:51.160" end="00:55.020" itunes:key="L17">Then if nothing more, give me one more last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果再无其他</span></p><p begin="00:55.020" end="00:59.150" itunes:key="L18">Too weak to turn you down, once you get me started<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我太软弱 无法拒绝你</span></p><p begin="00:59.150" end="01:01.650" itunes:key="L19">But we can't keep messin' around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们不能再继续纠缠</span></p><p begin="01:01.650" end="01:03.580" itunes:key="L20">Just leaves you broken hearted<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只会让你心碎</span></p><p begin="01:03.580" end="01:04.670" itunes:key="L21">Baby, please<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 求求你</span></p><p begin="01:04.670" end="01:08.360" itunes:key="L22">Hold me in the dark, kiss me through the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黑暗中拥抱我 整夜亲吻我</span></p><p begin="01:08.360" end="01:12.970" itunes:key="L23">One more (one more), last time (last time)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次 最后一次 最后一次</span></p><p begin="01:12.970" end="01:15.970" itunes:key="L24">You and me, been a good time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你和我</span></p><p begin="01:15.970" end="01:20.720" itunes:key="L25">Not a long time, but it's all I'm tryin' to be (oh-whoa)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然短暂 但很美好</span></p><p begin="01:20.720" end="01:23.910" itunes:key="L26">We fell into this rendezvous<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们陷入了这场邂逅</span></p><p begin="01:23.910" end="01:25.750" itunes:key="L27">Told me you're fine everytime<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次你都说你很好</span></p><p begin="01:25.750" end="01:28.140" itunes:key="L28">What do you want me to do?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你想要我怎么做</span></p><p begin="01:28.140" end="01:29.880" itunes:key="L29">Oh, what should I do?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我该如何是好</span></p><p begin="01:29.880" end="01:34.950" itunes:key="L30">You got me feeling so damn guilty, like I did somethin' wrong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我感到如此内疚</span></p><p begin="01:34.950" end="01:39.690" itunes:key="L31">Only laid out my intentions, wasn't leading you on<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只是坦白了我的心意</span></p><p begin="01:39.690" end="01:43.520" itunes:key="L32">Just don't know what I could say to lessen the pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是不知该说什么来减轻你的痛苦</span></p><p begin="01:43.520" end="01:46.580" itunes:key="L33">So I run away (way)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我选择了逃避</span></p><p begin="01:46.580" end="01:49.430" itunes:key="L34">Not tryin' to leave you out in the cold<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">并非想将你冷落一旁</span></p><p begin="01:49.430" end="01:54.080" itunes:key="L35">Never made it clear, never made it right (no, I never)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未明确表态 从未妥善处理 我从未做到</span></p><p begin="01:54.080" end="01:58.550" itunes:key="L36">I've been waitin' here, for at least a goodbye (goodbye)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在等待 至少一个告别 告别</span></p><p begin="01:58.550" end="02:03.030" itunes:key="L37">Show up at my door, look me in the eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出现在我门前 直视我的双眼</span></p><p begin="02:03.030" end="02:06.470" itunes:key="L38">Then if nothing more, give me one more last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果再无其他</span></p><p begin="02:06.470" end="02:10.870" itunes:key="L39">Too weak to turn you down, once you get me started<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我太软弱 无法拒绝你</span></p><p begin="02:10.870" end="02:13.350" itunes:key="L40">But we can't keep messin' around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们不能再继续纠缠</span></p><p begin="02:13.350" end="02:15.260" itunes:key="L41">Just leaves you broken hearted<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只会让你心碎</span></p><p begin="02:15.260" end="02:16.470" itunes:key="L42">Baby, please<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 求求你</span></p><p begin="02:16.470" end="02:19.750" itunes:key="L43">Hold me in the dark, kiss me through the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黑暗中拥抱我 整夜亲吻我</span></p><p begin="02:19.750" end="02:25.060" itunes:key="L44">One more (one more), last time (last time)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次 最后一次 最后一次</span></p><p begin="02:25.060" end="02:27.320" itunes:key="L45">You know, I like you, but it ain't that serious<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我喜欢你 但并没有那么认真</span></p><p begin="02:27.320" end="02:29.690" itunes:key="L46">Been straight up with you, not nefarious<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直对你坦诚 没有恶意</span></p><p begin="02:29.690" end="02:31.830" itunes:key="L47">Loved chasing you, Tom and Jerry-ish<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾像猫追老鼠般追逐你</span></p><p begin="02:31.830" end="02:34.050" itunes:key="L48">Can't commit to you, I got various<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法对你承诺 我心思多变</span></p><p begin="02:34.050" end="02:36.140" itunes:key="L49">Know you'd hope this turn into a thing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道你希望这段关系能更进一步</span></p><p begin="02:36.140" end="02:38.480" itunes:key="L50">Something more than just another fling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不只是短暂的欢愉</span></p><p begin="02:38.480" end="02:40.330" itunes:key="L51">Don't get me wrong bae, I love what we do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">别误会 宝贝 我喜欢我们之间的一切</span></p><p begin="02:40.330" end="02:42.930" itunes:key="L52">But I'm a man of many bitches, I need more than a few<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我有太多无法言说的秘密</span></p><p begin="02:42.930" end="02:47.240" itunes:key="L53">I'm not hitting you up, if you gon' hit me with the "What are we?" talk<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我需要的不止这些</span></p><p begin="02:47.240" end="02:49.200" itunes:key="L54">Thought you was all good, just hookin' up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然你之前只是想要保持随意的关系</span></p><p begin="02:49.200" end="02:51.480" itunes:key="L55">But now, you come at me with them feelings you caught<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但现在你却带着感情来找我</span></p><p begin="02:51.480" end="02:53.670" itunes:key="L56">I'm down to keep our situation, not the way that it was<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我宁愿保持我们原来的状态</span></p><p begin="02:53.670" end="02:56.020" itunes:key="L57">Call you up at 2:00 a.m., 'cause I'm alone with the buzz<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凌晨两点给你打电话 因为我独自一人喝醉了</span></p><p begin="02:56.020" end="02:58.330" itunes:key="L58">Matter fact, how 'bout tonight?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事实上 不如就今晚</span></p><p begin="02:58.330" end="03:01.320" itunes:key="L59">Let's do it again, one more, last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们再最后一次重温旧梦</span></p><p begin="03:01.320" end="03:05.810" itunes:key="L60">Never made it clear, never made it right (I never made it right)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从未明确表态 从未纠正错误</span></p><p begin="03:05.810" end="03:10.290" itunes:key="L61">I've been waitin' here, for at least a goodbye (bye)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在等待 至少一个告别</span></p><p begin="03:10.290" end="03:14.710" itunes:key="L62">Show up at my door, look me in the eye (oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">出现在我门前 直视我的双眼</span></p><p begin="03:14.710" end="03:18.630" itunes:key="L63">Then if nothing more, give me one more last time<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果再无其他</span></p><p begin="03:18.630" end="03:22.570" itunes:key="L64">Too weak to turn you down (oh-oh), once you get me started<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我太软弱 无法拒绝你</span></p><p begin="03:22.570" end="03:25.150" itunes:key="L65">But we can't keep messin' around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我们不能再继续纠缠</span></p><p begin="03:25.150" end="03:27.120" itunes:key="L66">Just leaves you broken hearted<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只会让你心碎</span></p><p begin="03:27.120" end="03:28.120" itunes:key="L67">Baby, please<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 求求你</span></p><p begin="03:28.120" end="03:31.580" itunes:key="L68">Hold me in the dark, kiss me through the night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在黑暗中拥抱我 整夜亲吻我</span></p><p begin="03:31.580" end="03:35.890" itunes:key="L69">One more (one more), last time (last time)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再一次 最后一次 最后一次</span></p></div></body></tt>